   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1992-04-29",
   "text": "Fairness and Equity Tax Act of 1992 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code to impose an additional minimum tax on: (1) a domestic corporation which is 25 percent foreign-owned; or (2) a foreign corporation engaged in a trade or business within the United States."
  }
